ness of Allah, highlighting the signs of creation and the importance of faith and patience. It encourages believers to reflect on the natural world and recognize the wisdom and authority of Allah in all things.", "short_description": "Surah Ar-Ra'd emphasizes the power and greatness of Allah, highlighting the signs of creation and the importance of faith and patience. It encourages believers to reflect on the natural world and recognize the wisdom and authority of Allah in all things."}]}, "developer_name": "Miracle Group", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://miraclegroup.work/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Miracle Group", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.miraclegroup.work/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27185756667691439"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818885_1556071369855118_8154093798278457473_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DYZxs99_SsYQ7kNvwHOogDR&_nc_oc=AdpBUfk1JvfgI-peJQyK37_AAcH-zEwqfTdoEFf5LvfOWRDrDDsc82bIArLbF4kpFMA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR-bX2SjgigiE0_bDZh0CSBW1ztFi_Oe5Rp7UJFghYtSQ&oe=6AFDDF29"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_tria